{% comment %}
Dossier Footer Section
Related findings and transition hub navigation for dossier pages
{% endcomment %}

<section class="dossier-footer">
  <div class="dossier-footer__container">

    <div class="dossier-footer__section">
      <h2 class="dossier-footer__title">Research Behind This Protocol</h2>
      <p class="dossier-footer__subtitle">
        The cold exposure protocol is grounded in these key findings and research articles.
      </p>

      <div class="dossier-footer__findings">
        
        <article class="dossier-finding">
          <div class="dossier-finding__header">
            <span class="dossier-finding__badge">Finding 003</span>
            <h3 class="dossier-finding__title">
              <a href="/blogs/journal/cold-immersion-sympathetic-activation">Cold Immersion Triggers Rapid Sympathetic Nervous System Activation</a>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="dossier-finding__excerpt">
            Cold water exposure activates the sympathetic nervous system within 30 seconds. The effect is acute and measurable: increased norepinephrine, elevated heart rate, and thermogenic response.
          </p>
          <div class="dossier-finding__meta">
            <span class="dossier-finding__date">Published Feb 2026</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="dossier-finding">
          <div class="dossier-finding__header">
            <span class="dossier-finding__badge">Finding 001</span>
            <h3 class="dossier-finding__title">
              <a href="/blogs/journal/thermogenesis-and-metabolic-priming">Thermogenesis and Metabolic Priming: How Cold Exposure Extends Wakefulness</a>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="dossier-finding__excerpt">
            The elevated metabolic state triggered by cold exposure persists for 15–30 minutes post-exposure. During this window, your core temperature remains elevated and your nervous system remains in heightened readiness.
          </p>
          <div class="dossier-finding__meta">
            <span class="dossier-finding__date">Published Jan 2026</span>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dossier-footer__section">
      <h2 class="dossier-footer__title">Explore the Full Transition</h2>
      <p class="dossier-footer__subtitle">
        This protocol is one intervention within the Sleep → Wakefulness transition. Explore the complete framework.
      </p>

      <div class="dossier-footer__ctas">
        <a href="/pages/sleep-to-wakefulness" class="dossier-footer__cta">
          <span class="dossier-footer__cta-title">Sleep → Wakefulness Hub</span>
          <span class="dossier-footer__cta-description">View findings, research, and other protocols</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="dossier-footer__cta">
          <span class="dossier-footer__cta-title">Mirellis Observatory</span>
          <span class="dossier-footer__cta-description">Browse all transitions and findings</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dossier-footer {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    background: #faf7f2;
  }

  .dossier-footer__container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .dossier-footer__section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .dossier-footer__section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .dossier-footer__title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .dossier-footer__subtitle {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .dossier-footer__findings {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .dossier-finding {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .dossier-finding:hover {
    background: #f5f2ed;
  }

  .dossier-finding__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .dossier-finding__badge {
    display: inline-block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    background: #4a90e2;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .dossier-finding__title {
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .dossier-finding__title a {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a18;
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 1.4;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .dossier-finding__title a:hover {
    color: #666;
  }

  .dossier-finding__excerpt {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .dossier-finding__meta {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #999;
  }

  .dossier-footer__ctas {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  }

  .dossier-footer__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .dossier-footer__cta:hover {
    background: #f5f2ed;
  }

  .dossier-footer__cta-title {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .dossier-footer__cta-description {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #666;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .dossier-footer {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .dossier-footer__title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .dossier-footer__subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .dossier-footer__finding-header {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .dossier-footer__ctas {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .dossier-finding {
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .dossier-finding__title a {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Dossier Footer",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}